# 发布部署包(deploy/):镜像 tar 与前端产物由 CI/本地构建生成,不入库;
# site/ 只保留占位页,正式部署包由 CI 用 frontend_vue/dist 覆盖;
# .env/Caddyfile 由 deploy.sh 根据 config.json 生成,config.json 含真实凭据不入库
deploy/.env
deploy/config.json
deploy/Caddyfile
deploy/images/
deploy/site/*
!deploy/site/index.html

